# Files copied from nginx/ into /etc/nginx/conf.d/apen_support/ on every deploy.
# Read by customsh/siteupdate.sh, deploy/INSTALL.sh and
# scripts/install-hardening-upgrade.sh, so a new include only has to be added
# HERE. tests/nginx-deploy-files.test.ts fails when server.conf or an .inc
# includes a file this list does not name.
#
# Not listed on purpose: loader.conf (installed as conf.d/apen_support.conf),
# admin-token.inc (authored on the host by proxy/sync-nginx-admin-token.sh),
# managed-*.conf (written by the /admin nginx editor).
server.conf
security-headers.inc
admin-acl.inc
blocked-hosts.inc
proxy-headers.inc
login-redirect.inc
installer-download.inc
